      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نِفَارٌ</span></b>  a subst. from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَفَرَتِ الدَّابَّةُ</span>. Ex. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى الدَّابَّةِ</span>
